     31 August 1830 – Dionysius Lardner to W G  Proposing a work to Longman (for Godwin?)<lb/>
    15 September 1830 Dr Lardner – has consulted with the Directors of the <title>Cyclopedia</title> and they are not willing to go ahead with further publication at this point</p></note>
